# Lab03-01  BCD to Seven Segment Decoder   (Template-01.dig: In[4] -> A..G)
# Glyphs from the lab sheet: 6 = a c d e f g,  7 = a b c f,  9 = a b c d f g
.i 4
.o 7
.ilb In3 In2 In1 In0
.ob A B C D E F G
.type fd
#       ABCDEFG
0000    1111110
0001    0110000
0010    1101101
0011    1111001
0100    0110011
0101    1011011
0110    1011111
0111    1110010
1000    1111111
1001    1111011
# 10..15 never occur
1-1-    -------
11--    -------
.e
